    // QA M5 2026-09-25: an unusual length is flagged before the yes, both ways, never as a "minimum".
    ['usual length','9 hours of VO is flagged before the yes (QA M5)',
      '*BUZZ / Jem Lim / TL*\n*Date:* October 1, 2027 (Fri)\n*Time:* 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM\n*Room:* Studio F\n*Session Type:* VO Recording\n\nConfirm to book. (yes/no)',
      {},x=>/Heads up: 9 hours is longer than VO Recording sessions usually run \(1–3 hours\)\.\nReply only with "yes" to book/.test(x.output)&&!/Still book/.test(x.output)&&/Confirm to book\.$/.test(x.output)],
    ['usual length','15 minutes: the model note is replaced, never "minimum" (QA M5)',
