    // v162 (Howard, 2026-09-28)
    ['v162','a leaked tool instruction is removed','Free in that window: Studio 1, Studio 2. List exactly these and no others.',{},x=>!/List exactly/.test(x.output)&&/Studio 2\.$/.test(x.output)],
